 659 │ 645 │ def solarize(image: Image.Image, threshold: int = 128) -> Image.Image:                  
 660 │ 646 │     """                                                                                 
 661 │ 647 │     Invert all pixel values above a threshold.                                          
 662 │ 648 │                                                                                         
 663 │ 649 │     :param image: The image to solarize.                                                
 664 │ 650 │     :param threshold: All pixels above this grayscale level are inverted.               
 665 │ 651 │     :return: An image.                                                                  
 666 │ 652 │     """                                                                                 
