 37  │ 37  │                                                                                         
 38  │ 38  │     (whitespaces including linebreaks are ignored). The option 4                        
 39  │ 39  │     describes a series of symmetry operations (in this case a                           
 40  │ 40  │     4-rotation), the pattern is described by:                                           
 41  │ 41  │                                                                                         
 42  │ 42  │     - . or X - Ignore                                                                   
 43  │ 43  │     - 1 - Pixel is on                                                                   
 44  │ 44  │     - 0 - Pixel is off                                                                  
 45  │ 45  │                                                                                         
 46  │ 46  │     The result of the operation is described after "->" string.                         
 47  │ 47  │                                                                                         
 48  │ 48  │     The default is to return the current pixel value, which is                          
 49  │ 49  │     returned if no other match is found.                                                
 50  │ 50  │                                                                                         
 51  │ 51  │     Operations:                                                                         
 52  │ 52  │                                                                                         
 53  │ 53  │     - 4 - 4 way rotation                                                                
 54  │ 54  │     - N - Negate                                                                        
 55  │ 55  │     - 1 - Dummy op for no other operation (an op must always be given)                  
 56  │ 56  │     - M - Mirroring                                                                     
 57  │ 57  │                                                                                         
 58  │ 58  │     Example::                                                                           
